        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2085",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Google Search Console is a free dashboard where Google shows which queries surfaced your site, what people clicked, and what's blocking indexing. Unlike contractor promises, these numbers can't be dressed up: it's Google's own view. If it's not connected yet, that's the first thing to do after reading this."
